  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">K2K Entrepreneurship C&#xf4;te d&apos;Ivoire</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">During this K2K project foreseen in 2021, an extensive training on entrepreneurship will be delivered to 3 Ivorian knowledge institutes (KI). Through a needs assessment, a context and KI-specific entrepreneurship course will be identified with all stakeholders involved. Special attention will be given to female and social entrepreneurship to increase the social impact of these efforts. The KIs from C&#xf4;te d&apos;Ivoire will form a pool of centres of excellence for entrepreneurial education so that lessons learnt and experiences can be shared and potential future projects and collaborations can be sparked.</narrative>
  </description>
